Veranda SID Player
==================

A port of the CommanderSID project's SID player (SIDPLAY.PRG,
software/rev-b/sidplay.s) to Veranda, the GEOS-style desktop for the
Commander X16, as a native Veranda application.

Credit: the CommanderSID project (the X16-SID card, its firmware and its
software), Copyright (C) 2026 Marcin Spoczynski. The player's behaviour,
its mailbox protocol and its tables come from it.

Ported from the CommanderSID working tree at commit 03007ec, with
uncommitted changes as of 2026-11-16.

Licence: GPL-3.0-or-later, as the CommanderSID project's software (its
LICENSE.md). The full text is in COPYING.

Copied or derived from CommanderSID, with attribution in each file:
  src/card.s           software/common/mbox.inc (the mailbox's frames, CRC-8),
                       software/common/sid.inc (the window, ARM/DISARM),
                       software/rev-b/sidplay.s (the envelope model, the
                       uploads, the requests), software/rev-b/sidplay_tables.inc
  src/tune.c           software/rev-b/sidplay.s (play_file, read_header,
                       upload, play_song, song_lengths, roms_load, stop, pause)
  src/viz.c, viz.s     software/rev-b/sidplay.s (draw_voices, draw_scopes,
                       scope_sample, tracker_row, draw_adsr, draw_filter),
                       sidplay_tables.inc (the note boundaries)
  src/list.c           software/rev-b/sidplay.s (read_dir's order)
  tools/mksongidx.py   tools/songlengths/mksongidx.py (SONGLEN.IDX)
  tests/sidlog.py      sim/e2e/test_e2e.py (mb_requests: decoding the log)
  tests/tunes/psid.cfg, testtune.s, rsidtune.s
                       software/sid-tunes (CC0 test tunes)

Modelled on Veranda's own programs (MIT, ~/Projects/geos): the MOD Player's
window, playlist and transport icons (x16-mod, examples/veranda), Shell 2's
title bars, the colour theme (sdk/lib/theme.h), the SDK (vrchoose.h).

The emulator used by the gate is x16emu's branch "sidcard"
(~/Projects/x16-emulator-sidcard): CommanderSID's emulator patches and
firmware core (GPL) merged with the -mousescript branch.

No C64 ROM images are part of this repository: RSID tunes need the user's
own C64ROMS.BIN (CommanderSID's tools/c64roms) on the SD card.
HVSC tunes are not part of it either.
